149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (I chose this project because I have interest in Non-Linear Dynamics, which led me to choose Lorenz Attractor as my project. I was curious to see how simple equations could produce the complex patterns seen in Strange Attractor visualizations.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
150 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 121 0 R
/E (So I ran these simulation in a limited embedded enviornment hardware, turning abstract mathematics into something intuitive and visually attractive.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
