/P 400 0 R
/E (Coordinates and Scaling: A major challenge was that the mathematical variables range roughly from -20 to 20, but the screen pixels are 320x240. I had to implement a mapping function: map\(x * 20, -400, 400, 0, 320\) to scale the simulation up and center it on the display.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
