203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 405 0 R
/E (Issues Faced: Initially, I encountered a completely white screen. By double-checking my wiring, I realized my SPI clock and data lines were swapped. Furthermore, the rotary encoder was floating, giving random inputs, which I fixed by declaring the pins as INPUT_PULLUP.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
